direction: right

actor User
participant Discord
participant Koga Bot
participant SQLite
participant Riot API

User -> Discord: /vincular Nome#Tag
Discord -> Koga Bot: InteractionCreate (vincular)
Koga Bot -> Riot API: GET /riot/account/v1/accounts/by-riot-id/Nome/Tag
Riot API --> Koga Bot: PUUID
Koga Bot -> SQLite: INSERT INTO tracked_players (puuid, guild_id)
SQLite --> Koga Bot: Success
Koga Bot --> Discord: Embed (Jogador vinculado)
Discord --> User: Mensagem de sucesso

note: A cada 5 minutos
Koga Bot -> SQLite: SELECT * FROM tracked_players
SQLite --> Koga Bot: List of Players
loop For each player
  Koga Bot -> Riot API: GET /lol/match/v5/matches/by-puuid/puuid/ids
  Riot API --> Koga Bot: Match IDs
  alt New Match Found
    Koga Bot -> Riot API: GET /lol/match/v5/matches/matchId
    Riot API --> Koga Bot: Match Data
    Koga Bot -> Koga Bot: HistoryEngine.analyze(Match Data)
    Koga Bot -> SQLite: SELECT notification_channel_id FROM guild_configs
    SQLite --> Koga Bot: Channel ID
    Koga Bot -> Discord: Send Message (Análise Histórica Irônica)
    Koga Bot -> SQLite: UPDATE tracked_players SET last_match_id = matchId
  end
end
